OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Facross all parts, with rain in the
OL,7,Feast, locally heavy for Kent. Low
OL,8,Fcloud spreads more widely across the
OL,9,Fregion overnight with further patchy
OL,10,Frain developing. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDamp and cloudy to start with
OL,13,Fpatchy light rain. Cloud likely to
OL,14,Fbreak through the morning with sunny
OL,15,Fspells and very warm temperatures
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Very mild overnight with
OL,17,Fstrengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
