OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith rain on Wednesday, locally heavy,
OL,7,Fclearing to sunny spells. Cloudy with
OL,8,Fisolated showers on Thursday. Breezy
OL,9,Fand rather cloudy on Friday.
OL,10,FTemperatures closer to average.
